diff --git a/evidence/02b-independent-classification.txt b/evidence/02b-independent-classification.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..b1b6d41e5ddd910369ce65943bb9a3ea2c6c3693
--- /dev/null
+++ b/evidence/02b-independent-classification.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,78 @@
+Independent classification from frozen verification.k and supplied MPY semantics
+
+rule-913248f07e570f8e9cf4e10ccd2e45330ef636bc76303ff5ad67835ed0374797
+lines 9-46; DEFINITION
+GRADE-STEP is a compile-time macro naming the exact nested source AST.
+
+rule-ab056d115b33e511e623da01fcf497700ccb79847bda7824277b21bcbf6345af
+lines 49-57; DEFINITION
+GRADE-PROGRAM is a compile-time macro naming the whole translated program AST.
+
+rule-9407ea7d6a4de9439363534f67694ee47e6ff907df9b35ff34b4a866b6602e7b
+line 61; DEFINITION
+Defines isGradeNumber as isInt(V) orBool isFloat(V).
+
+rule-c7226673454c9937bb81a182a982d47a41b4594d2a6ea2a53b050512a0f2120a
+line 64; DEFINITION
+Empty-sequence base equation for allGradeNumbers.
+
+rule-43811671f02c87468177174e87d1e0fa17daa38184b24c78d16b3da6de2f02be
+lines 65-66; DEFINITION
+Constructor recurrence for allGradeNumbers.
+
+rule-4aeb120c39e619e56b1bb2949769afb0de9f65a14815f8f8304abf8eabb853b0
+line 72; DEFINITION
+Int case defining the gradeEq summary by fixed intToF and eqF.
+
+rule-4b0057401ad369826c0c0f086d2de62b6bbdf480fcdb4ce5c3b9324e5f6b73cb
+line 73; DEFINITION
+Float case defining the gradeEq summary.
+
+rule-1dcc8c06aaff13c93012f8657da7bc9eee86e8cd2b9481c7d964bc6d833b79f8
+lines 74-75; DEFINITION
+Guarded nonnumeric totalization case defining gradeEq.
+
+rule-8b8204b28122ab97e84e35c1504bdd05d5beed4934819f44dabcbedbc9f85f32
+line 78; DEFINITION
+Int case defining the gradeGt summary by fixed intToF and gtF.
+
+rule-5e4220b4a59610d50f112f372bc52b526f8251e55fcb996f2f236bbe7a0db863
+line 79; DEFINITION
+Float case defining the gradeGt summary.
+
+rule-5924db7e5f35f3f96f7f05931067b1ad392bdb7dcfde5b27f1927e6c1875992c
+lines 80-81; DEFINITION
+Guarded nonnumeric totalization case defining gradeGt.
+
+rule-bb0819476c6343e9119c99a78b2ae8eb72ebad42dbc170a9eaa3c4af6f39f115
+lines 84-87; DOMAIN_LEMMA
+Guarded equality dispatch over a symbolic Val. It restates the fixed
+Float/Float and Int/Float applyCmp equations under isGradeNumber, but Stage 1
+installs it in VERIFICATION before proving the claims and contains no earlier
+rule-free proof of this exact statement. It is relevant because every grading
+branch compares a dynamic grade value to a Float threshold.
+
+rule-79c1c8d9ff74acff507b7b4a319ee7d9d034df3550afdf9196f29291297713c8
+lines 88-91; DOMAIN_LEMMA
+Guarded greater-than dispatch over a symbolic Val. It restates the fixed
+Float/Float and Int/Float applyCmp equations under isGradeNumber, but Stage 1
+installs it before proving and contains no earlier rule-free proof. It is
+relevant to all strict threshold comparisons in the source program.
+
+rule-c5a38f6c6613309dfda5d4776797f7bf662da9f4d9a3f34f58ebec448836c677
+lines 96-133; DEFINITION
+Defines the named one-element gradeValue summary by the ordered threshold table.
+
+rule-f3847c739a1d22b36c279a649f98bc18c2073c8ec8582b54956c1f02f33dc66c
+line 138; DEFINITION
+Empty-suffix base equation for gradeAcc.
+
+rule-954dcecb4ff810ef1b6ce869747c0457f931b774b64fd1f2197b5d3a0265ac57
+lines 139-143; DEFINITION
+Tail recurrence defining gradeAcc by append and structural descent.
+
+Totals: 14 DEFINITION, 2 DOMAIN_LEMMA, 0 OPERATIONAL_RULE,
+0 PROVED_DERIVED_LEMMA.
+
+Both and only simplification rules are DOMAIN_LEMMA. The independent result
+matches lemma-discovery.json exactly.
